|desc=
You control dead matter around you, lying in the ground, decaying. When you enter combat and every {{ctl|10|30|12}} turns thereafter a ghoul automatically rises to fight for you. The ghoul will have base level equal to yours, adjusted by {{cs|Talent Level|(-6)|0.9|(+2)|5}}.

* At level 3 you can forcefully activate this spell to summon up to {{cts|1|5}} ghasts around you.<br>There will be additional diminishing returns if this number would exceed 6, in which case the number summoned will be limited to 6 + (Number - 6)<sup>0.7</sup>.
* At level 5 every 4 summoned ghouls or ghasts a ghoulking is summoned for free.
* Ghouls, ghasts and ghoulkings last for {{cts|5|10}} turns.		

Ghoul minions come in larger numbers than skeleton minions but are generally more frail and disposable.
